[00:21.69]Ive been hallucinating,
[00:21.69]我陷入了幻觉
[00:23.78]Issa cold cruel world in the dead of December.
[00:23.78]在这寒冬十二月 世界冷酷又冰冷
[00:27.39]Your love is diamond plated,
[00:27.39]你的爱是钻石般珍贵
[00:29.57]Not a scratch on your heart I would always remember.
[00:29.57]你的心毫无瑕疵 我会永远铭记
[00:32.53]You got a reputation,
[00:32.53]你声名远扬
[00:35.00]Yeah you’re larger than life got my mind on a bender,
