[00:50.82]我该如何是好
[00:53.25]If the rumors were true,
[00:53.25]如果传言属实
[00:54.92]Cuz your rays on my skin in the middle of the night,
[00:54.92]因为在那午夜 你的光芒洒在我肌肤上
[00:57.89]Just a flicker in my mind but it keeps me alive,
